lightly chaotic hop at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927250/extras/07b5a3569fd8b075f8c9e7af29a637ae.poster.avif?t=1770737763\" width=602 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927250/extras/07b5a3569fd8b075f8c9e7af29a637ae.webm?t=1770737763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927250/extras/07b5a3569fd8b075f8c9e7af29a637ae.mp4?t=1770737763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927250/extras/58ba0ccf414f021762a2f46a33d53d1d.avif?t=1770737763\" width=603 height=134 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Spend your hard earned frog points on a branching skill tree packed with upgrades for every corner of your pond. Whether you aim for maximum efficiency or just want ridiculously fancy frogs, the choice is yours. Every decision shapes your ecosystem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927250/extras/dcf84942a15afb48e690c295180b15df.poster.avif?t=1770737763\" width=602 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927250/extras/dcf84942a15afb48e690c295180b15df.webm?t=1770737763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927250/extras/dcf84942a15afb48e690c295180b15df.mp4?t=1770737763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927250/extras/d7035b2de703075337ac51eddf1cfe33.avif?t=1770737763\" width=603 height=134 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Once you complete your first run, you\u2019ll unlock different specializations and can play however you want. Do you want to automate everything with minimal interaction? Or maybe you prefer the opposite. How about a more generic build? The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927250/extras/fa72f89c45a58c4effd63ca8dfef67b0.poster.avif?t=1770737763\" width=602 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927250/extras/fa72f89c45a58c4effd63ca8dfef67b0.webm?t=1770737763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927250/extras/fa72f89c45a58c4effd63ca8dfef67b0.mp4?t=1770737763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Starfall Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927250/d0bef9d8e8075e3cbfee4e6b2cba57f223bec186/header.jpg?t=1770737763","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3927250/552748857/18c0b108f7160a2f2171a814af2de07e7192368e/1758651729/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758663936","